WEBVTT

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:30.756
laakiin waxaa jirtay dhibaatooyin.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:32.473
dhibaato ka mida

00:01:32.473 --> 00:01:35.106
waxay ahayd tiraabta codka ee Carabida

00:01:35.106 --> 00:01:38.105
taason lagu odhan karin codka reer Yurub

00:01:38.105 --> 00:01:40.372
iyadoon aad loogu celcelin.

00:01:40.372 --> 00:01:42.106
taas iga rumaysta

00:01:42.106 --> 00:01:44.323
sidoo kale, codadkaas iyaga ah

00:01:44.323 --> 00:01:46.237
waxay noqdeen kuwaan ka muuqan

00:01:46.237 --> 00:01:49.825
xarfaha ku jira luuqadaha reer Yurub.

00:01:49.825 --> 00:01:51.639
halkan waxaa ah mid ka mida khaladaadka

00:01:51.639 --> 00:01:53.523
xarafkan waa shiin,

00:01:53.523 --> 00:01:57.122
waxayna samaysaa codka aan filayno inuu yahay shi'-- "sh'"

00:01:57.122 --> 00:01:59.724
waana mid kamida xarfaha ugu horeeya

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.156
ee kelmada shay'un,